from (1)/(2)

${P \over {\frac{3}{2}P}} = {{$\left( {$\frac{2}{R}$} \right)$} \over {$\left( {{1 $\over$ {{$R_1$}}}} \right)$}} \Rightarrow R_{1} = \frac{R}{3}$

