For refraction through plano - Convex lens,

$m=-2=\frac{v}{u} $\begin{array}{ll} \Rightarrow  v=-2 u \\\\ \text { As, }  u=-30 \mathrm{~cm} \\\\ \Rightarrow  v=60 \mathrm{~cm} \end{array} 

Using lens formula, $\frac{1}{v}-\frac{1}{u}=\frac{1}{f} $\begin{aligned} \frac{1}{60}-\frac{1}{-30} & =\frac{1}{f} \\\\ \Rightarrow f  =20 \mathrm{~cm} \end{aligned} 

